,"session_date":"2023-04-20","session_datetime":"2023-04-20T16:15:00","session_id":"session_3","session_index":3,"source_sha256":"43e9666cf7ae6b66122c1ca502fd7b77b266e6e1b0fa7931f45988960d18b5e2","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":6}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Long time no see. I just went to an awesome music thingy in Tokyo - so cool!\n[S3T1] (dia_id: D3:1)\n\nDave: Hey Calvin! Great to hear from you. How was the music thingy in Tokyo? See any cool bands?\n[S3T2] (dia_id: D3:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! The festival in Tokyo was awesome! Didn't see any bands, but met lots of talented artists and industry people. Totally enriching!\n[S3T3] (dia_id: D3:3)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, sounds great! What did you learn from it?\n[S3T4] (dia_id: D3:4)\n\nCalvin: I learned a lot and got some great advice from professionals in the music industry. It was inspiring!\n[S3T5] (dia_id: D3:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Bet that was inspiring being surrounded by professionals. Did you get any advice from them?\n[S3T6] (dia_id: D3:6)","text_sha256":"4bf93d6b711713a050c62146028773d861a99a5a5b49032f42eb818b0f0d56ab","timestamp":"2023-04-20T16:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":32,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S6T7]"],"text_sha256":"b2b0ab51c9f60e8376c875a9a1317b288a61756445eaa3d0283edf4deb73782b"},{"dia_ids":["D6:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":35,"line_start":34,"source_locators":["[S6T8]"],"text_sha256":"703ec4ef77edcf6b004fa72c797a33a6bf5f2b68641fb708663c2b5ff2319396"},{"dia_ids":["D6:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":38,"line_start":37,"source_locators":["[S6T9]"],"text_sha256":"6b6baa4065c90c2e298cb41d673c6682275d496d418a2561eb8d01804cd41736"},{"dia_ids":["D6:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":41,"line_start":40,"source_locators":["[S6T10