a98050d9674d39d28e71758e653d9a0d55c","rendered_turn_sha256":"349c399793bc72a5379077525846c83882e35e12ad7c330b7f7754bc4d1166cb","session_date":"2023-03-23","session_datetime":"2023-03-23T11:53:00","session_id":"session_1","session_index":1,"source_sha256":"4a76241f0a3cbdaf03dc68c323a6fbac0e623398f5ab3b2657ad519ea5c992d0","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":14}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: I'm so excited to learn about Japanese culture and get a chance to expand.\n[S1T5] (dia_id: D1:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, learning about new cultures is awesome! Have you ever been to Japan?\n[S1T6] (dia_id: D1:6)\n\nCalvin: Never been there before. Fascinated by the traditions and can't wait to get a taste of the culture.\n[S1T7] (dia_id: D1:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Japan sounds amazing. Can't wait to hear all about it! When are you leaving?\n[S1T8] (dia_id: D1:8)\n\nCalvin: I'm heading there next month. I'll be staying in such a nice place while I'm there.\n\n\n[Image caption: a photo of a living room with a couch, table, and television]\n[S1T9] (dia_id: D1:9)\n\nDave: That looks cozy! Where'd you find a place to stay there?\n[S1T10] (dia_id: D1:10)\n\nCalvin: Wow, my agent found me this awesome place, so thankful!\n[S1T11] (dia_id: D1:11)\n\nDave: Awesome! Having a place to stay is key. What are your plans for the trip?\n[S1T12] (dia_id: D1:12)\n\nCalvin: I'm planning to explore the city, try out different local cuisines, and perhaps collaborate with musicians in the area.\n[S1T13] (dia_id: D1:13)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Collaborating with local musicians would be an amazing experience. How long are you planning to stay in Japan?\n[S1T14] (dia_id: D1:14)","text_sha256":"d29126d5f134dbea1778474732af5326d47f6f560b05316fc752590e6511213d","timestamp":"2023-03-23T11:53:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca